  "solution": "The logic followed here is: 2nd number - 1st number × 4 - 1 = 3rd number.\n\n(16, 33, 67)\n\n**__(33 - 16)__** × 4 - 1 = 67\n\n__**17 ×**____** 4**__ - 1 = 67\n\n__**68 - 1**__ = 67\n\n67 = 67 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(19, 39, 79)\n\n__(39 - 19)__ × 4 - 1 = 79\n\n__20 ×____ 4__ - 1 = 79\n\n__80 - 1__ = 79\n\n79 = 79 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (22, 45, 91)\n\n__(45 - 22)__ × 4 - 1 = 91\n\n__23 ×____ 4__ - 1 = 91\n\n__92 - 1__ = 91\n\n91 = 91 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) (21, 45, 90)\n\n__(45 - 21)__ × 4 - 1 = 90\n\n__24 ×____ 4__ - 1 = 90\n\n__96 - 1__ = 90\n\n95 ≠ 90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (18, 36, 80)\n\n__(36 - 18)__ × 4 - 1 = 80\n\n__18 ×____ 4__ - 1 = 80\n\n__72 - 1__ = 80\n\n71 ≠ 80 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (14, 27, 53)\n\n__(27 - 14)__ × 4 - 1 = 53\n\n__13 ×____ 4__ - 1 = 53\n\n__52 - 1__ = 53\n\n51 ≠ 53 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '(22, 45, 91)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
